# Test: Invalid usage of type/property query functions
# Concepts covered: resourcesOfType, resourcesWithProperty, resourcesWithPropertyObject, typesOfMembers, valuesOfObjectProperty
# Constraints tested: Arity violations
# This test validates that violations are caught for invalid type/property query function usage.

